	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1},
		{"sestop", id=2},
		{"sestop", id=3},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010030f"},
		line=1313,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I push through the tall grass, running as fast as I can.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Before I even noticed, Soujin has fallen completely unconscious on my back.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Gosh! Why did he have to pass out here of all places?",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Was it the shock from seeing those specks of light?",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Or perhaps it was that peach petal?",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Augh, it doesn't matter! I'll never forgive him for collapsing in a place like this!",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"I want him to always stay strong.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"No, I need him to stay strong, for me.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"That is what I decided during the war.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"As the Republican Army closed in, bringing despair in their wake, Soujin stood up and protected me.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I'll never forget the sight of his back in that moment. So reliable, sturdy as a mountain, yet somehow all too lonesome.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"All that is what makes Soujin who he is.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"And so...",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"That's why...",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I'll never forgive him for being sprawled out over my own like this!",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I'll bring him home no matter what.)”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"We don't have a second to waste.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Fweh, phew, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're awfully out of shape for someone born and raised in Iseya!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I did not... practice blade arts... every day as you did... Akari-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... I was always... more of an indoor persoooon!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll have you know I studied till midnight after my training every day!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come on, just a bit further!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I spot the tall chain-link fence in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The lights lining the top of the fence are hazy in the pouring rain.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Suddenly, a red dot appears on the side of Kotone's head.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look out!”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I knock Kotone aside in the same instant as gunshots ring out.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"A burst of bullets buries themselves in the grass right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you kindly, ma'am!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Save it and get moving!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Bullets pierce the air, whizzing just past my ear.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oomikami, bestow upon us Thy protection!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I've created a Spellshield around us... This should help protect us...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Kotone's legs are moving visibly slower.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Her use of magicks clearly took a heavy toll on her stamina.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, please leave me and go on ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why is everyone saying the exact same thing?!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But, but!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No buts!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I shift Soujin under my left arm and grab Kotone with my right.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Excuse me?!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're all jumping together.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold on tight if you don't wanna die!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I run with everything I have.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The fence is right before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Spellshield!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like I'm gonna...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like hell I'm gonna...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Die in a place like thiiiiisss!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I leap into the sky.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Pwah!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I poke my face out from the surface.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Only a little farther to the shore...",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“*Cough...* *burble...burble...*”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Oh, no.)”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I push Kotone's body up onto a moored boat.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Next, there's Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gh...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"My head sinks underwater for a moment.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The water in early spring is shockingly cold.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The instant I swallow a mouthful, strength immediately begins vacating my body.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"No... I can't give up yet.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"I have to save Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I heave Soujin onto the boat with all my strength.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(That should do it.)”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"I reach out to the side of the boat.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Huh... What...?)”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I don't see my own arm where it should be in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Not only that.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"My entire body feels as heavy as a sandbag.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The sound entering my ears becomes muffled.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"I'm sinking.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"When I realize that, the tension inside me suddenly dissipates.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I can't even feel my fingertips anymore.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Without even the energy to close my eyes, I stare at the receding surface of the water.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Forgive me, Mother. I failed to avenge you after all.)”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Feel free to laugh at your failure of a daughter.)”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"This is the end.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I'm going to die without accomplishing a single thing.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Soujin...)”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"In my fading moments, the last thing that passes through my mind is that familiar sight of his solitary back.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"I'm sorry.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I'm sorry...",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Ah...)”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Suddenly, an irresistible force pulls me up by my arm.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“*Cough, cough cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nicely done.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You've got some real guts.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"They scatter...",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Fluttering from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"One petal of Persica, and another.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Alas, o beloved, tell me why.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Must you continue your fight, even unto your tears run dry?",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"I force my eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"The scenery that leaps out to greet me is that of my own room.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"What am I doing here?",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Are you ready to awaken, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Unexpectedly, Kotone is kneeling right beside me, peering at my face.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank goodness. You're okay.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where's Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehehe. You ought to worry about yourself first, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama is unharmed.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Her life is not in peril, but she is still resting at the moment.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I sit up and unsheathe my wakizashi laying beside my pillow.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What happened after that?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“After you lost consciousness, Akari-sama and I managed to escape the Warrior District by the skin of our teeth.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We were being pursued by the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Kotone explains what happened in the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"From what I hear, the situation was extremely perilous.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is inexcusable. I've never felt so useless.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I place my hands on the tatami and prostrate myself.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, sir! There is absolutely no need for that.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Everyone has passed out once or twice at a critical juncture!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Really now?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, actually... Perhaps not...”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I apologize!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, sir! It was entirely out of your control, is what I mean to say!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Kotone defends me with a flurry of excuses.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am not upset in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, if I had not insisted on carrying out a memorial service, none of this would have happened.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, that's wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, it is not.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"As we furiously exchange bows with each other, the door opens.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A warrior has no excuse for suddenly passing out.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Exactly.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, awawa...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"This discussion is over.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I heard that you were the one who saved us. Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All I did was wait on standby like you told me.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And besides, it was the manager who brought the three of you back here.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be sure to thank him later. Right now, I want to thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"I had asked Hotori to come to the riverbank shortly before we were scheduled to return.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I wanted to be prepared in case anything went wrong.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"She must have called the manager because she deemed it safer to take us back by car.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Besides, if you're gonna praise anyone, praise Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She managed all that, even though she's not a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If it weren't for her, you and Kotone would be sleeping with the fishes right now.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm ashamed of myself.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"I wish I could just disappear.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm glad to see you're okay, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm gonna go check on Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"With a faint smile, Hotori leaves the room.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I've finally processed the situation.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"I check the clock to find that it's five in the morning.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"I must've been sleeping for a few hours.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, while you were sleeping, Hotori-sama came to express her gratitude to me.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She wanted to convey her appreciation as a warrior for the memorial service.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ahh. That's right.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Hotori shed tears from just hearing about Kotone's plans.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"She's been carrying the regrets of all the fallen warriors on her shoulders this entire time.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"She must have been constantly tormented by the guilt of being unable to put their souls to rest.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For her to go out of her way to thank you, she must truly be grateful.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It makes me feel blessed to have become a priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Allow me to thank you as well.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I lower my head to her in gratitude.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, right. You should know that she's terrible at expressing herself.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She might come off as an intimidating warrior, but she's actually a big softie, so don't let it get to you.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is that truly the case? I thought for certain that I had earned her enmity.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“On the contrary, I think she's quite fond of you.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is most reassuring. I was actually quite worried about it.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Kotone breathes a sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Would you mind if I go check on Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do not believe she is awake yet, but please, by all means.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, I have a matter I would ask of you, sir, so might I wait here for your return?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"At any rate, I just want to make sure Akari is safe and sound.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"I leave the room, heading the same direction that Hotori did.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"After assuring myself of Akari's wellbeing, I head back to my own room.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"She was sleeping peacefully, and she should eventually wake up of her own accord.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry to keep you waiting, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"I enter to find Kotone dozing off in her spot against the wall.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Is she drooling?)”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"I might be the only person to have ever seen Her Eminence in such an unsightly state.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"In fairness, I hear she made significant use of her magicks during their escape from the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"She must be well and truly exhausted.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"I should make sure my own body is in proper shape while I wait for her to wake up.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"With that decided, I embark on my usual conditioning training.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Huuh! Hnnn! Haah!)”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"I make sure to match my movements with my breathing.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Not bad... Even better than yesterday, in fact.)”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"I was worried about the repercussions of my fainting spell, but it seems like I'm in peak physical condition.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Alright, just three hundred more... Hmm?)”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"I glance to the side and meet eyes with a very wide-eyed Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, you're finally─”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Uhhhwaaaaaaa?!”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Like a centipede, Kotone scuttles to the nearest corner of the room before freezing in place.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawawaghhhh, Soujin-sama! Wh-What were you intending to do to me?!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was just waiting for you to finally wake up.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Rather than in my sleep, you'd insist on assaulting me while I'm awake?!”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What wonderful proclivities you have, I must say!”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't get what you're so upset about...”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Have you never imagined the feelings of a pure-hearted maiden who awakens to find a monstrous strongman doing high-speed push-ups before her very eyes?!”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nope.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I thought not!”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I'm so done...",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I would've felt bad about waking you.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you kindly for your consideration.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I do believe that if you had deigned to wake me up from the start, it might not have taken several years off my life...”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The lifespan of a priestess is short enough as it is. I beg you to not shorten mine even further.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Kotone slowly inches back to her original spot, smoothing down her disheveled hair with her hands.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry for giving you such a fright.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right!”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"I take a manjuu out from the refrigerator and heat it up in the microwave oven.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's nothing too special, but please go ahead and eat up.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oooh, that really is quite the fine specimen...”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, do not think that I am someone who can be won over with mere trifling sweets, is that understood?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"With a satisfied smile on her lips, she happily digs into the manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Looks like she is indeed someone who can be won over with mere trifling sweets.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, you said you had a question for me.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, yesh, abouf your body, shir.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Kotone swallows a mouthful of green tea and straightens her posture.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I beg your forgiveness, but I took the liberty of examining the condition of your body while you were asleep.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I should be thankful if anything. Was anything wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not at all, sir. Indeed, you are in most excellent condition.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“After all, it seems you are well enough to do push-ups at record speeds...”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Still holding that against me, I see.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, has a priestess ever mentioned anything in the past about the crest engraved on your body?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, none of the ones who've looked at me have mentioned it.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Kotone thinks for a moment.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As you are surely aware, spellcrests are sigils which are found engraved upon the bodies of all those with warrior's blood.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perhaps it would be more accurate to call them the true proof of the Forefather's lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“These crests have characteristic shapes related to different warrior bloodlines, and differentiating them is a basic skill for all priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And yet, this is the first time I have seen anything resembling your crest.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's news to me.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is that so, sir...?”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"Kotone makes an uncharacteristically serious face.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have a personal interest in this matter, so might you permit me to continue monitoring your physical condition moving forward?”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I should be the one asking you.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Our crests are what allow us to activate spellblades, right? If mine is in bad condition, I'll have problems when it matters the most.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I would be most obliged.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Kotone bows to me.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"That's the first time anyone has brought this up.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess has a formidable wealth of knowledge indeed.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does my fainting spell earlier have anything to do with my crest?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I have not the faintest idea.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“At the very least, there is certainly nothing wrong with your body.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then... why in the world did I...?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"The two of us both cock our heads in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That peach petal... No, it couldn't be.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, now that you mention it, I do believe I also saw one back in the Warrior District.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But it is hard to believe one could fall unconscious merely from touching a peach petal.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll ask Akari, too, just in case.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe that would be wise.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now, if there is nothing else, I shall be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Anything could still yet happen, Soujin-sama, so please do exercise moderation in your training.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Kotone begins to stand up.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, Kotone. I actually had a question I wanted to ask you about Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might that be?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's about when Akari was in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe you mentioned that you used to call her the\n'Lord' of some mountain or whatnot...”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, about that?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Kotone sits down again.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama lived on Mount Momiji, which was right next to the priestesses' seminary.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It was just her and her grandmother.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It was a very long while before any of us were even able to speak to her, so she built up quite the reputation among all the priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She trained in the blade arts from dawn to dusk, and I never saw their lights go off, even at night.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We all had very vivid imaginations, so our gossip became more and more embellished over time.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“For example, that she was the illegitimate child of the late Empress Suou, secretly honing her skills to someday exact her revenge.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Bullseye...",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The moniker 'Lord of Mount Momiji' was first coined in reference to these rumors that she was indeed a highborn.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However... could I ask that you keep the following a secret from Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Kotone asks while lowering her voice to a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We also called her the 'Lord' because she ruled over her dominion atop Mount Momiji with an iron fist. She was a most frightful personage indeed...”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Frightful?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"I knit my brow in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Her devotion to her training was frightfully intense, you see. She brooked no trespassers upon her dominion, lest they break her concentration.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Her grandmother was particularly terrifying. She would frequently rebuke Akari-sama as a wicked lord might their vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And so, all of us feared them as we might fear a tyrannical overlord.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"Akari's bladesmanship is indeed several cuts above that of a mere amateur.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"After all, her bladework carries an unmistakable conviction to cut down her enemies, a palpable will to kill with every strike.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Such a skill could never be taught even through years of daily practice in a dojo.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"Just how brutal was this training she underwent?",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"And just how tenacious was this elderly matron who taught her?",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“At any rate, Akari-sama had led a most harsh lifestyle until recently.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is why I was so overjoyed to discover her living out such a carefree life here in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A carefree life, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"I try to think of the last conversation I had with her that\ndidn't involve talk of rebellions or assassinations...",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed. Whenever she speaks with you, she wears a smile befitting a young maiden.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, she is one.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am not referring to her age.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Akari-sama I knew back in Iseya never once showed me a smile like that.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Her expression always had this grim sense of tragedy about it, like that of a cornered beast.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And so, I truly believe she is very blessed indeed to have met you, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wouldn't that be nice.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I really mean it, jeez!”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"Kotone retorts, puffing out her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, thank you for this valuable information.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It was my pleasure. My apologies for taking so much of your time.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Kotone begins to stands up.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll be counting on you to appraise Akari's raiment.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, certainly, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"With one last bow, Kotone turns and leaves.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
